Virtua Tennis 3 VR
==================

Unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by SEGA. Virtua
Tennis is a trademark of SEGA. This repository contains no game files, no
game code (original or recompiled), no game libraries (lib/libCg.so is
read from the player's own copy at start-up; the generated
recomp_solib_relocs.c holds only a relocation table and checksums and is
not committed) and no game art; players supply their own
copy of the game and build the app themselves.

