Art
---
The launcher icon (quest/vt3/src/main/res) and the Quest start-up screen
(games/vt3/src/splash_art.c) are original art drawn by quest/tools/vt3_icon.py
and quest/tools/vt3_splash.py (text set in macOS system fonts at build
time). The game's own title logo is not included: the app reads it from the
player's game files at start-up.
